    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/584dc1248771864220c4193937820bd4.avif?t=1755028869\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join two college girls on a trip to an abandoned cabin. The cabin has had numerous rumors about missing people going to it, and so, the girls are investigating both that and the cabin\u2019s history for their final project. The cabin has a mysterious mirror with a thousand faces on it, too. Will their faces be added to the mirror frame like the rest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Phoebe and Onyx, our main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/6ab9b0ba5363ca5887eec8114ff3b0ea.avif?t=1755028869\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/07158297162e55a53c16a6dd593e71ba.avif?t=1755028869\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8k words of dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acted segments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 endings, including a true ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A CG gallery with over 20 unique CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential bonus scenes of the two main girls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/584dc1248771864220c4193937820bd4.avif?t=1755028869\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join two college girls on a trip to an abandoned cabin. The cabin has had numerous rumors about missing people going to it, and so, the girls are investigating both that and the cabin\u2019s history for their final project. The cabin has a mysterious mirror with a thousand faces on it, too. Will their faces be added to the mirror frame like the rest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Phoebe and Onyx, our main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/6ab9b0ba5363ca5887eec8114ff3b0ea.avif?t=1755028869\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/07158297162e55a53c16a6dd593e71ba.avif?t=1755028869\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8k words of dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acted segments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 endings, including a true ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A CG gallery with over 20 unique CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential bonus scenes of the two main girls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
